OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1786454337
OL,3,CTwo Cumbrians signed up for sports
OL,4,Cdevelopment programme
OL,6,FTwo young Cumbrians have been signed
OL,7,Fup for a sports development programme
OL,8,Fin the county.
OL,10,FAlice Maddams, ranked number one in
OL,11,Funder 14 javelin and Jack Bailey, an
OL,12,Faspiring footballer, have been some of
OL,13,Fthe Cumbrian sports stars of the
OL,14,Ffuture to be welcomed onto the scheme.
OL,16,FEveryone Active's Sporting Champions
OL,17,Fprogramme provides free access to
OL,18,Fstate-of-the-art facilities in the
OL,19,Fcounty.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/5
