PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1786454337
OL,3,CTwo Cumbrians signed up for sports
OL,4,Cdevelopment programme
OL,6,FAlice Maddams said: "I'd like to get
OL,7,Fto the under-18 World Championships
OL,8,Fand I would like to win the English
OL,9,Fschools.
OL,11,F"I would also like to get to the
OL,12,FCommonwealth Games when I am older."
OL,14,FAlice's mum, Pippa Maddams, said:
OL,15,F"Being recognised as a younger athlete
OL,16,FI think is really important for
OL,17,Fanyones sporting progress so she feels
OL,18,Fpart of it and the people in the gym
OL,19,Fknow her.
OL,26,@nD@UOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/5
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
