PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1786454337
OL,3,CTwo Cumbrians signed up for sports
OL,4,Cdevelopment programme
OL,6,F"It is part of that extended
OL,7,Fcommunity."
OL,9,FSixteen-year-old Jack Bailey has also
OL,10,Fjoined the programme. A standout at
OL,11,Fthe Workington Reds academy for four
OL,12,Fyears, he's picked up multiple
OL,13,FCoaches' Player of the Year awards
OL,14,Fwhile competing in the Junior Premier
OL,15,FLeague.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/5
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
