PN,30704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1786454337
OL,3,CTwo Cumbrians signed up for sports
OL,4,Cdevelopment programme
OL,6,FHe said: "It is a great experience to
OL,7,Fbe a sporting champion, it definitely
OL,8,Fgives me more motivation. With the gym
OL,9,Fequipment and being in a new
OL,10,Fenvironment it is going to help me get
OL,11,Fbetter."
OL,13,FHis mum Alison is delighted to see her
OL,14,Fson welcomed onto the programme.
OL,16,FShe said: "Being involved in the
OL,17,Fscheme is good for the kids,
OL,18,Fespecially Jack. You feel valued as a
OL,19,Fsportsperson and from a parents point
OL,20,Fof view it is good because it saves
OL,21,Fthe parents a little bit of money."
